{"n": 143, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "143.webp", "text": "11-258\n\nTurn cylinder no, 1 to TOC — cylinder no, 6\noverlaps.\n\nHold crankshaft with Special Tool 11 2 300\n\nDetach hose (5) and protective cover.\nJastallation:\n\nFirst tighten cylinder head cover and then\nProtective cover\n\nLoosen bolts (1 and 2) and nut (3).\nUntighten toothed belt and take off of camshaft\nsprocket.\n\ninstallation\n\nTurn camshaft to overlap valves of cylinder no.\n6 and hold camshaft with Special Tool 11 3 090\nbefore mounting the cylinder head\n\nInstall and tighten toothed belt, see 11.31 110\n\nUnscrew bolts in order of 14 through 1 and\ntake off cylinder head\n\nInstallation:\n\nKeep oil out of cavities since otherwise bolts\ntightened to correct torque might not exert\nsufficient pressure on cylinder and, in addition,\ncause cracks in crankcase.\n\nClean cylinder head bolts.\n\nLubricate threads and bearing surfaces of bolt\nheads with light coat of oil.\n\nReplace cylinder head gasket - measure piston\nProtrusion, see 11 12 101.\n\nTighten bolts in 3 steps in order of 1 through 14\nto specified torque*\n\nAdjust valve clearance 11 34 004.\n\nCheck static adjustment of injection pump, see\n13 51 005.\n\nIn 3rd step (cylinder head cover removed again\nafter running engine warm) tighten cylinder head\nbolts to torque angle\" with Special Too!\n\n11 2 110 regardless of engine temperature\n\n* See Specifications", "words": [["11-258", 0.4666, 0.0239, 0.54, 0.0471], ["Turn", 0.2624, 0.0663, 0.2852, 0.0769], ["cylinder", 0.2888, 0.067, 0.3273, 0.0789], ["no,", 0.3313, 0.069, 0.343, 0.0769], ["1", 0.3526, 0.0663, 0.3536, 0.0763], ["to", 0.3587, 0.069, 0.3678, 0.0769], ["TOC", 0.3718, 0.0663, 0.3931, 0.0769], ["—", 0.3987, 0.0716, 0.4037, 0.0736], ["cylinder", 0.4078, 0.067, 0.4458, 0.0789], ["no,", 0.4498, 0.069, 0.4615, 0.0769], ["6", 0.4681, 0.0663, 0.4737, 0.0769], ["overlaps.", 0.2624, 0.0829, 0.3009, 0.0948], ["Hold", 0.2634, 0.3017, 0.2857, 0.3123], ["crankshaft", 0.2893, 